<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.12.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_1:
<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.12.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">Federal regulators filed a civil fraud lawsuit against Angelo Mozilo,</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.13" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
