<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.13.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">co-founder of Countrywide Financial Corp.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.14" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_2:
Dominique de Menil founded the Menil Collection.</span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.14.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Understanding Process:
- In Relation_Summarization_1, the relation is between a legal action (lawsuit) and Angelo Mozilo, who is associated with Countrywide Financial Corp as a co-founder.
- In Relation_Summarization_2, the relation is between Dominique de Menil and the Menil Collection, where Dominique is the founder.
The relations differ in nature: one involves <span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.14.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">a legal action against</span> a co-founder, and the other involves <span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.14.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">founding an institution</span>.</span>
</span></span></span>
