<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.23.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- In Relation_Summarization_2, the relation is between a person (Dominique de Menil) and a collection (Menil Collection), where the person is identified as the founder of the collection.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab1.1.1.1.1.1.1.24" class="ltx_tr">
