<figure id="A1.SS4.tab2" class="ltx_table">
<p id="A1.SS4.tab2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:417.0pt;height:790.2pt;vertical-align:-392.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<span class="ltx_thead">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#DBDBDB;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Cases2 - Error Analysis from three Stages LLMs</span></span></span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_tbody">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.SS4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\blacktriangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>▶</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\blacktriangleright</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> Input:</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">1. The Honduran interim government would not be recognized by the international community, <span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Jacinto Suarez</span>, Nicaraguan deputy to the <span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Central American Parliament</span> ( PARLACEN ) said Monday.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">2. SEC’s McKown to Step Down as Chief Counsel for Enforcement Her replacement probably will inherit pending high-profile cases, including a fraud lawsuit against Goldman Sachs and an insider-trading case against <span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Angelo Mozilo</span>, the former chief executive officer of <span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Countrywide Financial</span> Corp.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.SS4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\blacktriangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>▶</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\blacktriangleright</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> Gold Relation Labels and Ground Truth:</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab2.1.1.1.1.1.1.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">1. org:top_members/employees</span>
