<span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">1. Relation_Summarization_1 focuses on Dworin’s recollection of the Cuban leader’s acknowledgment of Jews, indicating a historical or <span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.15.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">cultural recognition</span>.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.16" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">2. Relation_Summarization_2 describes Laura Silsby’s role as the leader of a group of American missionaries, indicating a leadership or organizational relationship.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.17" class="ltx_tr">
