<span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The relations are not similar: the first is about historical acknowledgment, while the second is about <span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.17.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">leadership</span> within a group.</span>
