<span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.35.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">In both cases, the relation is the same: A person is <span id="A1.SS4.tab3.1.1.1.1.1.1.35.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFCC;">originally</span> from a country.</span>
</span></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></p>
</figure>
