<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">1. This news comes from <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Karr Ingham</span>, an economist who created the <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Texas Petro Index</span> ( TPI ), which is a service of the Texas Alliance of Energy Producers.</span>
</span></span></span>
