<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">2. <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ahmed Rashid</span>, a Pakistani journalist, is the author of “Descent into Chaos: The United States and the <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Failure of Nation Building</span> in Afghanistan, Pakistan and Central Asia.”</span>
</span></span></span>
