<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_1 identifies Karr Ingham as the creator of the Texas Petro Index.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.16" class="ltx_tr">
