<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_2 identifies Ahmed Rashid as the author of ”Failure of Nation Building.”</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.17" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The key relation in both summaries is one of creation or authorship.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.18" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.18.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.18.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">In both cases, the first <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.18.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">subject</span> (Karr Ingham and Ahmed Rashid) is responsible for <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.18.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">creating or authoring</span> the second <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.18.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">subject</span> (Texas Petro Index and ”Failure of Nation Building”).</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.19" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.19.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Conclusion: Yes.</span>
</span></span></span>
