<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.25.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.25.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_1 highlights a <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.25.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">creator-creation</span> relationship where Karr Ingham is the creator of the Texas Petro Index.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.26" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.26.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.26.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.26.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_2 highlights an <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.26.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">author-work</span> relationship where Ahmed Rashid is the author of ”Failure of Nation Building.”</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.27" class="ltx_tr">
