<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.31.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_1: Karr Ingham is the creator of the Texas Petro Index.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.32" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.32.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.32.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.32.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_2: Ahmed Rashid is the author of ”Failure of Nation Building.”</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.33" class="ltx_tr">
