<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.34.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.34.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.34.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">In Relation_Summarization_1, the relation is <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.34.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFCC;">organizational</span>, indicating that Karr Ingham is the person who created the Texas Petro Index.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.35" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.35.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
