<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.35.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">In Relation_Summarization_2, the relation is <span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.35.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFCC;">authorship</span>, indicating that Ahmed Rashid is the author of a specific book.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.36" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.36.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
