<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.36.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The nature of these relations is different: one is about creation of an index, and the other is about authorship of a book.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab4.1.1.1.1.1.1.37" class="ltx_tr">
