<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">1. ( 1:32 ) R. “ William Kunstler : Disturbing the Universe ” – Filmmakers <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Emily</span> and <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sarah Kunstler</span> explore the life of their father, the late radical civil rights lawyer who fought with Martin Luther King, Jr. and represented the famed “Chicago 8” activists who protested the Vietnam War.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
