<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">2. <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">He</span> is also survived by his parents and a sister, Karen Lange, of Washington, and a brother, <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Adam Lange</span>, of St Louis.</span>
</span></span></span>
