<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- In Relation_Summarization_1, the relation is between Sarah Kunstler and Emily, who are <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.15.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">collaborators</span> in a filmmaking project.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.16" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
