<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- In Relation_Summarization_2, the relation is between ”He” and Adam Lange, who are siblings.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.17" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.17.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The keywords in Relation_Summarization_1 (”filmmakers,” ”exploring”) indicate a <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.17.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">professional and collaborative</span> relationship.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.18" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.18.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
