<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.25.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_1 identifies Sarah Kunstler and Emily as collaborators in a filmmaking project about their father.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.26" class="ltx_tr">
