<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.26.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_2 identifies a familial relationship between ”He” and Adam Lange as siblings.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.27" class="ltx_tr">
