<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.27.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The keywords in Relation_Summarization_1 are ”filmmakers” and ”exploring,” indicating a <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.27.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">professional</span> and <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.27.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">collaborative</span> relationship.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.28" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.28.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.28.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.28.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The keywords in Relation_Summarization_2 are ”survived by” and ”brother,” indicating a familial relationship.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.29" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.29.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.29.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.29.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The nature of the relationships in both summaries is different: one is professional/collaborative, and the other is familial.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.30" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.30.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
