<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.34.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Relation_Summarization_2: He is Adam Lange’s brother.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.35" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.35.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
