</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.36" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.36.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.36.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.36.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">In Relation_Summarization_1, the relation is familial, indicating that Sarah Kunstler and Emily are sisters.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.37" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.37.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.37.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.37.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">In Relation_Summarization_2, the relation is also <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.37.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFCC;">familial</span>, indicating that ”he” is Adam Lange’s <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.37.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFCC;">brother</span>.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.38" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.38.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.38.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.38.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">In both cases, the relation is the same: they are <span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.38.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#CCFFCC;">siblings</span>.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.39" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab5.1.1.1.1.1.1.39.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
