<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.SS4.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\blacktriangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>▶</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\blacktriangleright</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> Input:</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">1.<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">China</span>’s National Development and Reform Commission (<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">NDRC</span>) on July 1 released a tape recording as evidence of the traders’ mung bean price manipulation.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:398.3pt;">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">2. A US recession is likely to affect the industry, but strong growth in key Asian economies such as China and South Korea will drive regional travel demand, the <span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Pacific Asia Travel Association</span> (<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">PATA</span>) said.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></span></span>
