<span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.13.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS4.tab6.1.1.1.1.1.1.13.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FFCCCC;">NDRC is an abbreviation for China’s National Development and Reform Commission.</span></span>
</span></span></span>
