<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Ratio of positives and negatives on the original training partition of one-shot NYT29 and our sampled version.
<span id="A1.T5.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Positive items</span> (<math id="A1.T5.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r,r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r,r</annotation></semantics></math>): pairs where both sentences express the same relation <math id="A1.T5.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>.
<span id="A1.T5.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Negative items with no_relation</span> (<math id="A1.T5.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r,\text{no\_relation}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>no_relation</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r,\text{no\_relation}</annotation></semantics></math>): pairs where one sentence expresses a relation <math id="A1.T5.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> and the other is labeled as no_relation.
<span id="A1.T5.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Negative items without no_relation</span> (<math id="A1.T5.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r,r^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r,r^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>): pairs where the two sentences express different relations <math id="A1.T5.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.T5.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, neither being no_relation.</figcaption>
</figure>
