Each row corresponds to a relation type, where the <span id="A1.T8.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Original</span> column reports the number of instances in the full dataset and the <span id="A1.T8.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Sampled</span> column reports the number of instances included in our one-shot sampled version.
