</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 15.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.8em;--ltx-fo-height:9.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="128.53" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 125.84)" width="509.21"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS11.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.8em;">
<span id="A1.SS11.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS11.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are given two sentences. Follow the three steps below to determine whether they express a similar relation.
<br class="ltx_break">Step1: are the relations between “{paraphrased_sentence_subject}” and 
<br class="ltx_break">“{paraphrased_sentence_object}” in {paraphrased_sentence} and between “{test_sentence_subject}” and “{test_sentence_object}” in {test_sentence} similar? Focus on the keywords in the {paraphrased_sentence} an {test_sentence} that convey relations.
<br class="ltx_break">Generate the understanding process, followed by Yes or No in a separate line.
<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS11.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS11.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="672.38" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 672.38" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,672.38) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#2934BE;" fill="#2934BE" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 7.61 L 0 664.77 C 0 668.97 3.41 672.38 7.61 672.38 L 542.39 672.38 C 546.59 672.38 550 668.97 550 664.77 L 550 7.61 C 550 3.41 546.59 0 542.39 0 L 7.61 0 C 3.41 0 0 3.41 0 7.61 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 7.61 L 0.69 617.77 L 549.31 617.77 L 549.31 7.61 C 549.31 3.79 546.21 0.69 542.39 0.69 L 7.61 0.69 C 3.79 0.69 0.69 3.79 0.69 7.61 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.38 625.09)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32em;--ltx-fo-height:3.08em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="45.36" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 42.66)" width="442.79"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS11.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32em;">
